    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call them but they are closed for the weekend and i can't really wait until monday to feel better. i've taken advil for headaches for years and it's always been fine for me. is there any reason why being pregnant would change things for a regular dose like 200mg? it feels like a pretty small amount to worry about.",
